# Bells: your bell sounds at every pull: standing, on time, and far too soon (a clash, scored as a bad blow, the blow
# due still to come); listening, the keys are quiet while the tower rings
wait 800
turn SELECT 16
wait 400
tap PLAY
turn K2 2
wait 100
key 7 down
key 7 up
wait 50
expect blows 0
tap PLAY
wait 150
key 7 down
key 7 up
wait 50
expect clashes 1
expect blows 1
wait 470
key 7 down
key 7 up
wait 50
expect clashes 1
expect blows 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect ringing 0
